原本剧本安排演这个角色的演员没空。

716
00:34:30.970 --> 00:34:31.890
Michael Naughton.
迈克尔·诺顿。

717
00:34:32.370 --> 00:34:36.550
Michael Naughton, Michael's improv teacher from email surveillance.
迈克尔·诺顿，也就是在《邮件监控》里迈克尔的即兴表演老师。

718
00:34:37.210 --> 00:34:39.130
I'm sorry, but that would have been amazing.
不好意思，但那绝对太赞了。

719
00:34:39.130 --> 00:34:40.750
That would have been so funny.
那一定会非常搞笑。

720
00:34:41.050 --> 00:34:45.510
I mean, that's the guy who took away Michael's pretend guns in improv class.
我是说，那可是个在即兴表演课上没收了迈克尔假枪的家伙。

721
00:34:45.650 --> 00:34:49.850
Also, you guys, if you ever get a chance to see Michael Naughton on stage, he's so hilarious.
还有啊，各位，如果你们有机会去看迈克尔·诺顿的现场演出，他真的超搞笑。

722
00:34:50.370 --> 00:34:52.650
Well, I thought Greg Collins did a wonderful job.
不过，我觉得格雷格·柯林斯演得很棒。

723
00:34:52.730 --> 00:34:53.110
He did.
确实很棒。

724
00:34:53.210 --> 00:34:53.710
He was perfect.
他太适合了。

725
00:34:53.710 --> 00:34:57.630
He even looked how I thought a delivery guy in this type of movie would look.
他甚至长得就像我想象中这种电影里的送货员。

726
00:34:57.750 --> 00:34:57.990
Yes.
没错。

727
00:34:57.990 --> 00:35:01.690
Did you notice at 41 seconds, his shirt is unbuttoned all of a sudden?
你有没有注意到在41秒的时候，他的衬衫突然解开扣子了？

728
00:35:01.950 --> 00:35:03.070
No, I didn't.
没有，我没注意到。

729
00:35:03.170 --> 00:35:04.630
Was that to show the blood?
那是为了露出血迹吗？

730
00:35:04.930 --> 00:35:05.390
Yes.
是的。

731
00:35:05.610 --> 00:35:09.990
So, he had like a navy button up and then all of a sudden at 41 seconds, it's unbuttoned.
他原本穿着一件深蓝色扣子衬衫，然后突然在41秒时，扣子解开了。

732
00:35:10.070 --> 00:35:10.690
I love that.
我喜欢这个细节。

733
00:35:11.310 --> 00:35:13.390
Randy said that the guns were dummy guns.
兰迪说那些都是假枪。

734
00:35:13.410 --> 00:35:19.950
They held no ammunition and they put all the sound effects and the muzzle flashes in during post-production.
里面没有子弹，所有的音效和枪口焰都是在后期制作时加上去的。

735
00:35:20.530 --> 00:35:25.150
I watched that scene knowing that it was done in post-production and I kind of couldn't believe it.
我明知那是后期特效还去看了那个镜头，简直有点难以置信。

736
00:35:25.270 --> 00:35:29.390
That is wild because you could see Steve as Michael kind of flinching, you know?
这太疯狂了，因为你能看到史蒂夫饰演的迈克尔好像在退缩，对吧？

737
00:35:29.670 --> 00:35:30.210
I know.
我知道。

738
00:35:30.350 --> 00:35:31.190
He did the kickback.
他做了后坐力的动作。

739
00:35:31.370 --> 00:35:33.150
That's some good fakey kickback acting.
那假装后坐力的演技还挺像那么回事的。

740
00:35:33.290 --> 00:35:34.030
It really was.
确实如此。

741
00:35:34.990 --> 00:35:41.310
We also had a fan question from Madhu P in Toronto, Canada, who says,
我们还收到了来自加拿大多伦多的马杜·P的粉丝提问，他说，

742
00:35:41.310 --> 00:35:46.050
I immediately recognized the music from The Bourne Identity when I first watched this episode.
我第一次看这集的时候，马上就听出背景音乐是《谍影重重》里的。

743
00:35:46.350 --> 00:35:48.610
How much did it cost to get the rights?
买下版权花了他多少钱？

744
00:35:49.770 --> 00:35:53.150
Well, I'm impressed that you spotted that.
嗯，你能听出来我很佩服。

745
00:35:53.370 --> 00:35:55.350
It was The Bourne Identity.
那就是《谍影重重》的音乐。

746
00:35:55.490 --> 00:35:56.630
It was scripted.
剧本里就是这么写的。

747
00:35:57.370 --> 00:36:00.590
Randy Cordray said it cost $25,000 to get that.
兰迪·科德雷说版权花了两万五千美元。

748
00:36:01.210 --> 00:36:05.690
BJ said he thought Michael Scott would have pirated it off of like a DVD he had.
BJ说他觉得迈克尔·斯科特肯定是从他有的某张DVD上盗版的。

749
00:36:06.010 --> 00:36:06.230
Totally.
完全有可能。

750
00:36:06.510 --> 00:36:06.730
Right?
对吧？

751
00:36:06.910 --> 00:36:07.190
Yeah.
是啊。

752
00:36:07.190 --> 00:36:11.430
Well, at the end of this scene, Michael's going to say, clean up on aisle five.
好吧，在这场戏结束时，迈克尔会说，五号过道需要清理。

753
00:36:11.990 --> 00:36:13.530
We talked about this with BJ.
我们和BJ讨论过这个。

754
00:36:13.870 --> 00:36:18.430
I went to the table redraft of this script and they had two phrases from the very beginning.
我去参加了这个剧本的围读重写，他们从最开始就有两个短语。

755
00:36:18.650 --> 00:36:24.410
It made it all the way to the shooting draft and it was recorded, but they ultimately went with
它一直保留到拍摄剧本并被录制下来，但他们最终还是采用了

756
00:36:24.410 --> 00:36:25.650
clean up on aisle five.
五号过道需要清理。

757
00:36:25.950 --> 00:36:27.750
The other one was return to sender.
另一个是退回寄件人。

758
00:36:30.090 --> 00:36:32.090
It even made it into the bloopers.
它甚至还被收录进了NG花絮里。

759
00:36:32.390 --> 00:36:33.270
I think we should hear it.
我觉得我们应该听听看。

760
00:36:34.110 --> 00:36:35.190
Return to sender.
退回寄件人。

761
00:36:36.470 --> 00:36:37.670
Clean up on aisle five.
五号过道需要清理。

762
00:36:41.030 --> 00:36:41.470
Okay.
好的。

763
00:36:41.830 --> 00:36:46.370
So clearly, clean up on aisle five is the thing that made everyone crack up and that's how it won.
所以很明显，五号过道需要清理是那个让所有人捧腹大笑并胜出的梗。

764
00:36:46.490 --> 00:36:48.010
It seems like it, doesn't it?
看起来确实如此，不是吗？

765
00:36:48.450 --> 00:36:50.570
And then Michael has this talking head where he says,
然后迈克尔有一个单人访谈镜头，他说，

766
00:36:50.710 --> 00:36:54.430
after three years of writing, one year of shooting, four years of reshooting,
经过三年的写作，一年的拍摄，四年的补拍，

767
00:36:54.630 --> 00:36:59.290
and two years of editing, I have finally completed my movie, Threat Level Midnight.
以及两年的剪辑，我终于完成了我的电影《威胁级别：午夜》。

768
00:37:00.030 --> 00:37:04.010
Jenna, it took Michael Scott and you and I the same amount of time to write something.
珍娜，迈克尔·斯科特和你还有我，写一样东西花的时间竟然是一样的。

769
00:37:04.630 --> 00:37:06.330
Are you talking about our book?
你是在说我们的书吗？

770
00:37:06.590 --> 00:37:10.270
Yes, it took us three years and seven months to write our book.
是的，我们写书花了三年零七个月。

771
00:37:12.470 --> 00:37:16.130
So the episode begins with Erin making an announcement in the bullpen.
所以剧集开始时，艾琳在开放式办公区做了一个宣布。

772
00:37:16.290 --> 00:37:17.030
Michael is with her.
迈克尔和她在一起。

773
00:37:17.290 --> 00:37:20.630
She says, Threat Level Midnight is complete.
她说，《威胁级别：午夜》完成了。

774
00:37:21.810 --> 00:37:25.790
And Michael's willing to watch it with everyone, but only if everyone is dying to see it.
迈克尔愿意和大家一起看，但前提是大家都极其渴望看到它。

775
00:37:26.710 --> 00:37:28.930
The Jim and Pam talking head is so good.
吉姆和帕姆的单人访谈太棒了。

776
00:37:29.430 --> 00:37:30.650
We are so giddy.
我们太兴奋了。

777
00:37:30.830 --> 00:37:31.930
You're so giddy.
你太兴奋了。

778
00:37:32.330 --> 00:37:36.950
Also, when I rewatched this, I thought John looked a little sweaty throughout this episode.
另外，当我重看这一集时，我觉得约翰在这集的整个过程中看起来有点出汗。

779
00:37:37.630 --> 00:37:37.950
What?
什么？

780
00:37:37.950 --> 00:37:38.630
I don't know.
我不知道。

781
00:37:38.770 --> 00:37:40.330
I don't know if I was really tired.
我不知道我是不是真的很累。

782
00:37:40.430 --> 00:37:42.430
As golden face or as Jim?
是作为黄金脸还是作为吉姆？

783
00:37:42.570 --> 00:37:44.350
As Jim in the bullpen.
作为办公区里的吉姆。

784
00:37:44.350 --> 00:37:45.890
I was like, I wonder if it was a hot day.
我在想，那天是不是很热。

785
00:37:46.050 --> 00:37:49.770
I even went to the shooting draft to see the week we filmed it to see the date.
我甚至去查了拍摄剧本，看我们拍摄的那周，查了一下日期。

786
00:37:49.770 --> 00:37:51.170
I was like, oh, I bet it was in the summer.
我当时想，哦，我敢打赌那是在夏天。

787
00:37:51.350 --> 00:37:52.230
No, it was January.
不，那是在一月。

788
00:37:52.830 --> 00:37:54.650
But, J.K., you look a little sweaty.
但是，J.K.，你看起来确实有点出汗。

789
00:37:55.070 --> 00:37:56.830
I wonder what that was about.
我在想那是怎么回事。

790
00:37:56.850 --> 00:37:57.570
Just him?
只有他吗？

791
00:37:57.830 --> 00:37:58.910
I thought so.
我是这么觉得的。

792
00:37:59.190 --> 00:38:00.030
Sorry, J.K.
对不起，J.K.

793
00:38:00.050 --> 00:38:03.230
I just thought you looked – you had a little bit of a glow.
我只是觉得你看起来——你有点容光焕发。

794
00:38:03.710 --> 00:38:04.450
He had a glow.
他容光焕发。

795
00:38:04.590 --> 00:38:05.090
He had a glow.
他容光焕发。

796
00:38:05.310 --> 00:38:05.630
All right.
好的。

797
00:38:06.410 --> 00:38:09.970
Pam tells Michael they definitely want to watch the movie, and after he leaves,
帕姆告诉迈克尔他们绝对想看这部电影，在他离开后，

798
00:38:09.970 --> 00:38:16.510
she gives the bullpen a little pep talk to set the right mood for watching this movie.
她给办公区的人做了一次简短的鼓动演讲，为观看这部电影营造合适的心情。

799
00:38:16.830 --> 00:38:18.190
Kind of a mom speech.
有点像妈妈的发言。

800
00:38:18.610 --> 00:38:19.330
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

801
00:38:19.470 --> 00:38:24.530
She says, so let's stay positive, and no laughing, no comments, just positive energy,
她说，那我们保持积极，不要笑，不要评论，只要正能量，

802
00:38:24.530 --> 00:38:26.390
and we'll have a pure fun day, okay?
然后我们会度过纯粹欢乐的一天，好吗？

803
00:38:27.710 --> 00:38:29.630
And Creed's like, thanks, Mom.
克里德就像是在说，谢谢你，妈妈。

804
00:38:32.050 --> 00:38:33.230
Everyone's really excited.
大家都非常兴奋。

805
00:38:33.230 --> 00:38:35.030
They start to gather in the conference room.
他们开始聚集在会议室里。

806
00:38:35.170 --> 00:38:36.950
Phyllis is going to bring in some popcorn.
菲莉丝要带一些爆米花进来。

807
00:38:37.230 --> 00:38:40.670
And Holly did not know that Michael had made a movie,
而且霍莉不知道迈克尔拍过一部电影，

808
00:38:40.670 --> 00:38:43.410
and he's really excited for her to see it.
他非常期待她能看到它。

809
00:38:43.470 --> 00:38:44.550
And she says, I can't wait.
她说，我等不及了。

810
00:38:45.030 --> 00:38:50.510
The first shot of the film is a picture of the exterior of Scarn Mansion.
电影的第一个镜头是斯卡恩宅邸外景的一张照片。

811
00:38:50.830 --> 00:38:54.890
And we got a fan question from Davina Kaye in Illinois, who said,
我们收到了来自伊利诺伊州达维娜·凯的一位粉丝提问，她说，

812
00:38:55.130 --> 00:38:57.990
in looking at the main image of Scarn Manor in the movie,
在看电影中斯卡恩庄园的主画面时，

813
00:38:58.150 --> 00:39:03.670
you can see in the bottom right-hand corner of the screen a small picture of Carol's face.
你可以在屏幕右下角看到一张卡尔面部的小照片。

814
00:39:04.090 --> 00:39:07.990
Did Michael use an image of one of Carol's real estate listings?
迈克尔是不是用了卡尔的一处真实房源图片？

815
00:39:08.990 --> 00:39:09.550
Yes.
是的。

816
00:39:09.650 --> 00:39:09.990
Yes.
是的。

817
00:39:09.990 --> 00:39:12.030
Yes, that is exactly what he did.
是的，他就是这么干的。

818
00:39:12.990 --> 00:39:16.530
Randy said that this image of this house was actually a stock photo,
兰迪说这栋房子的图片其实是一张库存照片，

819
00:39:17.170 --> 00:39:20.890
and we brought in Nancy Carell and took a picture of her,
我们请来了南希·卡瑞尔并给她拍了张照片，

820
00:39:21.010 --> 00:39:24.730
and Michael Gallenberg added it to the bottom of the photo.
然后迈克尔·加伦贝格把它加到了照片底部。

821
00:39:24.990 --> 00:39:27.830
Well, like I said, there is a DVD commentary for this episode,
嗯，就像我说的，这一集有DVD评论音轨，

822
00:39:27.850 --> 00:39:31.930
and Charlie Grandy shared that there was a lot of debate in the writer's room
查理·格兰迪分享说，编剧室里有很多争论，

823
00:39:31.930 --> 00:39:35.650
about the size of this house that they used for Michael Scarn's banner
关于他们为迈克尔·斯卡恩的横幅（庄园）所使用的这栋房子的大小，

824
00:39:35.650 --> 00:39:42.150
because they wanted it to be a house, realistically, that Carol would be showing in this area.
因为他们希望它是一栋现实中卡尔会在这个地区带看展示的房子。

825
00:39:42.150 --> 00:39:46.210
It did look like a mansion, definition of a mansion.
它看起来确实像座豪宅，完全符合豪宅的定义。

826
00:39:46.530 --> 00:39:51.130
It did, and the address is 451 Hanover Lane, Clark Summit, Pennsylvania.
确实如此，地址是宾夕法尼亚州克拉克萨米特汉诺威巷451号。

827
00:39:51.130 --> 00:39:52.190
I looked it up.
我查过了。

828
00:39:52.270 --> 00:39:53.230
I couldn't find a house.
我没找到这栋房子。

829
00:39:53.230 --> 00:39:54.450
Oh, we made it up.
哦，那是我们虚构的。

830
00:39:54.550 --> 00:39:55.130
Maybe so.
也许吧。

831
00:39:56.230 --> 00:39:59.370
Now we're going to see a montage of news clippings.
现在我们将看到一组新闻剪报剪辑。

832
00:39:59.810 --> 00:40:03.330
You know, Michael here as a director is trying to tell you a backstory, guys.
你知道，迈克尔作为导演在这里是想告诉你们一个背景故事，伙计们。

833
00:40:03.910 --> 00:40:09.350
So then we see a bunch of magazine covers announcing Michael Scarn's marriage to Catherine Zeta,
然后我们看到一堆杂志封面，宣布迈克尔·斯卡恩与凯瑟琳·泽塔结婚，

834
00:40:10.130 --> 00:40:14.090
and then the announcement of her death at the hands of Golden Face.
接着是宣布她在黄金脸的手下遇害。

835
00:40:14.330 --> 00:40:14.510
Yeah.
是的。

836
00:40:14.810 --> 00:40:16.830
We had a fan question from Kristen M.
我们收到了来自艾奥瓦州锡达福尔斯的克里斯滕·M的粉丝提问，她说，

837
00:40:16.970 --> 00:40:18.870
from Cedar Falls, Iowa, who said,
来自艾奥瓦州锡达福尔斯的克里斯滕·M，她说，

838
00:40:19.030 --> 00:40:22.850
did Catherine Zeta-Jones have to give her permission to be featured in this episode?
凯瑟琳·泽塔-琼斯必须授权才能在本集中出镜吗？

839
00:40:22.850 --> 00:40:24.830
Did she get paid as a guest star?
她作为客串明星拿到片酬了吗？

840
00:40:25.570 --> 00:40:26.450
Actually, no.
其实并没有。

841
00:40:26.850 --> 00:40:29.250
We did not pay her or ask her permission.
我们没有付钱给她，也没有征求她的许可。

842
00:40:29.490 --> 00:40:30.790
Was it like a stock photo?
这就像是一张库存照片吗？

843
00:40:30.790 --> 00:40:35.150
It was a stock photo that we bought from the photographer for $790.
这是一张我们从摄影师那里以790美元买来的库存照片。

844
00:40:35.930 --> 00:40:40.450
Yeah, and then Michael Gallenberg took a picture of Steve dressed in a tuxedo,
对，然后迈克尔·加伦贝格拍了一张史蒂夫穿着燕尾服的照片，

845
00:40:40.550 --> 00:40:41.910
and then that's how they made the picture.
然后他们就是这样合成这张照片的。

846
00:40:42.130 --> 00:40:43.390
Well, it's a very good picture.
嗯，这是一张非常好的照片。

847
00:40:43.490 --> 00:40:44.530
I thought she looked beautiful.
我觉得她看起来很漂亮。

848
00:40:44.770 --> 00:40:46.370
And you know, she was excited.
而且你知道，她很兴奋。

849
00:40:46.370 --> 00:40:48.190
Her family is a fan of The Office,
她的家人是《办公室》的粉丝，

850
00:40:48.210 --> 00:40:51.950
and she even came on our podcast for the client and read our summary.
她甚至还上了我们的播客节目担任客户并宣读了我们的总结。

851
00:40:52.130 --> 00:40:55.530
And we had a huge cutout of her that we put next to us when we recorded
而且我们有一个她的大型纸板立牌，录音的时候就放在我们旁边，

852
00:40:55.530 --> 00:40:57.250
because she had to send in an audio clip,
因为她必须发来一段音频片段，

853
00:40:57.330 --> 00:40:59.070
but it was like she was right in the room with us.
但感觉她就像和我们共处一室一样。

854
00:40:59.070 --> 00:41:01.790
She was our first A-list gueSt.
她是我们第一位一线大牌嘉宾。

855
00:41:01.950 --> 00:41:02.570
I think so.
我也这么觉得。

856
00:41:02.790 --> 00:41:03.030
Yeah.
对。

857
00:41:03.330 --> 00:41:04.530
Even though she was a cutout.
尽管她只是个立牌。

858
00:41:04.710 --> 00:41:05.130
That's right.
没错。

859
00:41:05.530 --> 00:41:09.430
Well, now we're going to find Skarn face down in bed,
好了，接下来我们会发现斯坎恩趴在床上，

860
00:41:09.590 --> 00:41:10.470
bottle of booze.
旁边是一瓶酒。

861
00:41:11.250 --> 00:41:14.050
His butler is going to be waking him,
他的管家会去叫醒他，

862
00:41:14.210 --> 00:41:16.310
holding a very elaborate silver tray,
手里端着一个非常精致的银托盘，

863
00:41:16.630 --> 00:41:18.130
very fancy breakfast tray.
非常华丽的早餐托盘。

864
00:41:18.130 --> 00:41:22.070
Did anyone else think Michael Skarn laying face down like that
有没有人觉得迈克尔·斯坎恩那样趴着的样子

865
00:41:22.070 --> 00:41:24.190
was like a little nod to Major League?
有点像是在向《大联盟》致敬？

866
00:41:24.850 --> 00:41:29.250
Do you remember that opening sequence where they go and find Tom Berenger,
还记得开场那个片段吗，他们去找汤姆·贝伦杰，

867
00:41:29.430 --> 00:41:32.430
and he's like face down with some booze?
他也是趴在地上，身边还有酒？

868
00:41:32.550 --> 00:41:34.230
No one else remember Major League?
难道就没人记得《大联盟》吗？

869
00:41:34.370 --> 00:41:34.750
Come on!
拜托！

870
00:41:34.950 --> 00:41:35.710
No, I do, and yes.
不，我记得，而且确实是。

871
00:41:35.890 --> 00:41:36.430
Thank you.
谢谢你。

872
00:41:36.890 --> 00:41:38.410
Wasn't it exactly the same?
这难道不是一模一样吗？

873
00:41:38.550 --> 00:41:38.710
Yes.
是的。

874
00:41:38.930 --> 00:41:39.310
Thank you.
谢谢。

875
00:41:39.790 --> 00:41:44.370
Well, I noticed that Steve's face was all scruffy when he wakes up.
我注意到史蒂夫醒来时满脸胡渣。

876
00:41:44.550 --> 00:41:45.710
He's been on a bender.
他一直在纵酒狂欢。

877
00:41:46.200 --> 00:41:47.450
He's not making good choices.
他做出了不明智的选择。

878
00:41:48.050 --> 00:41:51.810
Well, Randy said that in order to get that scruffy look,
兰迪说，为了弄出那种胡渣造型，

879
00:41:51.970 --> 00:41:54.010
they had to put a note on the call sheet
他们不得不在通告单上写个便条，

880
00:41:54.510 --> 00:41:56.970
reminding him not to shave before coming to work
提醒他上班前不要刮胡子，

881
00:41:56.970 --> 00:41:59.450
because Steve would always shave before coming to work.
因为史蒂夫上班前总是会刮胡子。

882
00:41:59.670 --> 00:42:01.850
And they had a little note that said, Steve, don't shave.
于是他们留了一张小纸条，上面写着：史蒂夫，别刮胡子。

883
00:42:02.010 --> 00:42:02.630
Don't shave.
别刮胡子。

884
00:42:03.110 --> 00:42:04.170
I have a question.
我有个问题。

885
00:42:04.430 --> 00:42:05.090
What is it?
什么问题？

886
00:42:05.150 --> 00:42:07.950
What was Michael's budget for this movie?
迈克尔拍这部电影的预算是多少？

887
00:42:09.030 --> 00:42:12.670
I don't know, but he made it over a very long period of time.
我不知道，但他是花了很长时间才拍完的。

888
00:42:12.830 --> 00:42:14.830
He did, but we're about to be in the Oval Office.
确实，但我们马上就要进入椭圆形办公室了。

889
00:42:14.830 --> 00:42:16.830
We've already seen what his condo looks like.
我们已经看过他的单身公寓长什么样了。

890
00:42:16.970 --> 00:42:20.410
It's candelabras and silver trays and whatnot.
到处都是烛台、银托盘之类的东西。

891
00:42:20.590 --> 00:42:24.830
But this Oval Office, which is supposed to be, I'm guessing, the conference room.
但是这个椭圆形办公室，我猜应该就是会议室吧。

892
00:42:24.970 --> 00:42:26.710
Yes, it is the conference room,
是的，它就是会议室，

893
00:42:26.770 --> 00:42:29.650
and you can even see reception through the door
而且当镜头对着迈克尔和德怀特时，

894
00:42:29.650 --> 00:42:32.990
when the shot is on Michael and Dwight.
你甚至能通过门看到前台。

895
00:42:33.230 --> 00:42:36.330
Or, I'm sorry, on Michael and Samuel.
或者，抱歉，是对着迈克尔和塞缪尔。

896
00:42:36.710 --> 00:42:37.110
Samuel.
塞缪尔。

897
00:42:37.450 --> 00:42:41.590
Did you see what was outside the window behind President Jackson?
你们看到杰克逊总统身后的窗外有什么吗？

898
00:42:41.910 --> 00:42:42.270
What?
什么？

899
00:42:43.950 --> 00:42:45.630
It was amazing.
太惊艳了。

900
00:42:46.030 --> 00:42:49.130
Our set dressing team was incredible.
我们的布景团队太不可思议了。

901
00:42:49.670 --> 00:42:54.790
I didn't know where we were when the scene started until we reversed the shot,
场景开始时我根本不知道我们在哪儿，直到我们把镜头倒放，

902
00:42:54.790 --> 00:43:00.550
but they put one of those, like, fakie light box window things behind him.
但他们在他身后放了那种类似于假灯箱窗户的东西。

903
00:43:00.610 --> 00:43:01.350
It was amazing.
太惊艳了。

904
00:43:01.910 --> 00:43:03.530
Michael put that there.
那是迈克尔放的。

905
00:43:04.090 --> 00:43:04.650
Yes.
是的。

906
00:43:04.810 --> 00:43:08.450
And he hung the elaborate curtains, and he got the sculptures and all the paintings.
而且那些精美的窗帘是他挂的，雕塑和所有的画作也是他弄来的。

907
00:43:09.070 --> 00:43:11.190
Did you catch the address of the White House?
你们注意到白宫的地址了吗？

908
00:43:12.050 --> 00:43:13.450
1600 Pennsylvania Avenue?
宾夕法尼亚大道1600号？

909
00:43:13.690 --> 00:43:15.830
Washington, D.C., comma, D.C.
华盛顿特区，逗号，特区。

910
00:43:16.370 --> 00:43:17.850
Oh, no, I did not.
哦，不，我没注意。

911
00:43:18.290 --> 00:43:19.610
Washington, D.C., D.C.
华盛顿特区，特区。

912
00:43:22.420 --> 00:43:28.760
Well, in this scene, the president is going to explain that Skarn's old enemy Golden Face
在这场戏里，总统将要解释说，斯坎的老仇人“金面”

913
00:43:28.760 --> 00:43:34.500
is planning to bomb the NHL All-Star Game, and he's also taken hostages.
正计划炸毁NHL全明星赛，而且他还劫持了人质。

914
00:43:34.780 --> 00:43:39.300
Now, this is really personal for the president because he owns the stadium.
这事对总统来说真的很私人，因为这座体育场是他的。

915
00:43:39.520 --> 00:43:41.060
It's his retirement plan.
这是他的退休计划。

916
00:43:41.220 --> 00:43:41.660
I know.
我知道。

917
00:43:41.760 --> 00:43:47.600
That's what the president is going to retire doing, is owning this one stadium.
总统退休后打算做的事，就是拥有这一座体育场。

918
00:43:48.560 --> 00:43:54.380
Skarn can't decide if he's going to take this job on or not, so he's got to flip a coin seven times.
斯坎拿不定主意要不要接这桩差事，所以他得连抛七次硬币。

919
00:43:54.460 --> 00:43:55.340
Best out of seven.
七局四胜。

920
00:43:55.580 --> 00:43:57.320
And he doesn't edit around that.
而且这段他完全没剪辑。

921
00:43:57.480 --> 00:43:59.500
You're going to see all seven coin flips.
你们会看到全部七次抛硬币的过程。

922
00:43:59.720 --> 00:44:00.360
That's right.
没错。

923
00:44:01.800 --> 00:44:05.360
So, something BJ said in an interview that I thought was so funny,
所以，B·J在一次采访中说的话我觉得特别逗，

924
00:44:05.980 --> 00:44:10.680
because, you know, there is an obsession with all-star games in this movie.
因为你知道的，这部电影里对全明星赛有一种执念。

925
00:44:10.680 --> 00:44:18.160
He said he thought that Michael Scott would view an all-star game as the most important event in sports,
他说他觉得迈克尔·斯科特会把全明星赛视为体育界最重要的赛事，

926
00:44:18.480 --> 00:44:21.020
even though in real life they're kind of irrelevant.
尽管在现实生活中这其实没什么关联性。

927
00:44:21.400 --> 00:44:23.440
It's more about the championship game.
人们更关注的应该是总决赛。

928
00:44:23.620 --> 00:44:24.040
Yes.
没错。

929
00:44:24.240 --> 00:44:28.260
He said he also liked that Golden Face had a thing for all-star games,
他说他也喜欢“金面”对全明星赛情有独钟这一点，

930
00:44:28.300 --> 00:44:33.880
and he had previously blown up the WNBA all-star game, which is how Catherine Zeta Skarn died.
他之前还炸毁过WNBA全明星赛，凯瑟琳·泽塔·斯坎就是这么死的。

931
00:44:34.160 --> 00:44:38.980
Did anyone else catch it four minutes and ten seconds that Daryl is clean-shaven?
有没有人注意到在第四分十秒的时候，达里尔把胡子刮得干干净净？

932
00:44:39.320 --> 00:44:39.960
I did.
我注意到了。

933
00:44:39.960 --> 00:44:40.500
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

934
00:44:40.760 --> 00:44:44.440
It's the first time we've seen Daryl without facial hair.
这是我们第一次看到达里尔没有留面部毛发。

935
00:44:44.920 --> 00:44:45.460
Ever.
从来没有过。

936
00:44:45.660 --> 00:44:46.760
In an episode of The Office.
在《办公室》的一集里。

937
00:44:46.960 --> 00:44:47.080
Yeah.
对。

938
00:44:47.720 --> 00:44:50.200
We got a fan question from Pieter G.
我们收到了来自波兰的皮特·G的粉丝提问，

939
00:44:50.340 --> 00:44:51.820
in Poland who said,
他问，

940
00:44:52.440 --> 00:44:59.800
did the writers have to plan out a theoretical timeline for Michael's film schedule so that hair and wardrobe could represent it?
编剧们是否必须为迈克尔的电影拍摄日程规划出一个理论上的时间线，以便发型和服装部门能呈现出来？

941
00:44:59.940 --> 00:45:04.320
For example, in addition to the fact that Daryl is clean-shaven,
比如说，除了达里尔刮了胡子这个事实之外，

942
00:45:04.600 --> 00:45:08.800
I noticed that we see Jim and Pam's season one and two hairstyle.
我注意到我们看到了吉姆和帕姆第一季和第二季的发型。

943
00:45:08.800 --> 00:45:11.100
Kelly has her up-do.
凯莉梳着她标志性的盘发。

944
00:45:11.360 --> 00:45:11.580
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

945
00:45:12.040 --> 00:45:14.580
Angela has her braid from the early days.
安吉拉梳着她早期那种辫子发型。

946
00:45:14.940 --> 00:45:18.880
I can only imagine the amount of planning and wardrobe meetings.
我完全可以想象这背后需要多少规划和服装会议。

947
00:45:18.880 --> 00:45:20.060
Oh, yes.
哦，是的。

948
00:45:20.160 --> 00:45:21.040
This was a whole thing.
这可真是一件大事。

949
00:45:21.260 --> 00:45:27.560
Just speaking of Daryl, Randy said that we had to pick up some Daryl work from a previous episode,
说到达里尔，兰迪说我们必须补拍一段之前某一集的达里尔的戏份，

950
00:45:27.560 --> 00:45:34.700
and hair and makeup had to add back a fake mustache goatee for Daryl to match at one point.
为了连戏，发型和化妆团队不得不给达里尔重新粘上一个假的小胡子和山羊胡。

951
00:45:34.700 --> 00:45:35.120
Oh, yeah.
哦，是啊。

952
00:45:35.280 --> 00:45:36.900
Craig talked about this on the DVD commentary.
克雷格在 DVD 随感里聊过这个。

953
00:45:36.900 --> 00:45:38.460
I think it was a big thing for him.
我觉得这对他来说挺重要的。

954
00:45:38.540 --> 00:45:41.900
He did not want to shave, and BJ really insisted on it.
他不想刮胡子，但 BJ 坚决要求他刮。

955
00:45:42.060 --> 00:45:49.400
I guess BJ wanted the character that Daryl plays, President Jackson, to be distinct in time from Daryl Philbin.
我猜 BJ 是想让达里尔扮演的角色——杰克逊总统，在时间感上和达里尔·菲尔宾有所区别。

956
00:45:49.620 --> 00:45:50.040
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

957
00:45:50.040 --> 00:45:56.100
But that meant he had to get this weird fakie beard in between as they cut back and forth.
但这意味着在他们切来切去的时候，他中间得贴上这个奇怪的假胡子。

958
00:45:56.460 --> 00:46:01.160
BJ also shared that they had to glue sideburns onto his face.
BJ 还分享说，他们得把鬓角胶水粘在他脸上。

959
00:46:01.320 --> 00:46:02.440
I didn't even notice that.
我甚至都没注意到。

960
00:46:02.640 --> 00:46:02.880
Yeah.
是啊。

961
00:46:03.080 --> 00:46:04.740
You know where you can really see it?
你知道在哪儿能真切地看出来吗？

962
00:46:04.840 --> 00:46:07.800
Well, first of all, if you go to 1 minute 55 seconds, you can see it.
好吧，首先，如果你快进到 1 分 55 秒，就能看出来。

963
00:46:07.960 --> 00:46:12.300
But then later in the episode, when he's on the ice skating rink, is when I really saw it.
但后来在这集里，当他在溜冰场上时，才是我真正看出来的时候。

964
00:46:12.500 --> 00:46:13.200
Oh, okay.
哦，好吧。

965
00:46:13.620 --> 00:46:15.000
Yeah, fakie sideburns.
对，假鬓角。

966
00:46:15.640 --> 00:46:17.480
Well, we all know Michael's going to take the job.
好吧，我们都知道迈克尔会接受这份工作。

967
00:46:17.620 --> 00:46:19.540
He didn't need to flip the coin seven times.
他根本没必要抛七次硬币。

968
00:46:20.140 --> 00:46:20.360
No.
没错。

969
00:46:20.840 --> 00:46:21.980
Clean up on aisle five.
五号过道需要清理。

970
00:46:22.120 --> 00:46:23.320
Clean up on aisle five, guys.
五号过道需要清理，伙计们。

971
00:46:23.980 --> 00:46:28.280
We are now going to the stadium where the hostages are being held.
我们现在要去关押人质的体育场了。

972
00:46:28.440 --> 00:46:28.760
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

973
00:46:29.420 --> 00:46:31.660
And we meet Golden Face.
然后我们遇到了黄金脸。

974
00:46:31.940 --> 00:46:32.460
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

975
00:46:32.640 --> 00:46:33.480
Played by Jim.
由吉姆扮演。

976
00:46:33.960 --> 00:46:37.400
Also a very giddy John Krasinski, who wanted the gold makeup.
还有一个非常兴奋的约翰·卡拉辛斯基，他想要金色的妆容。

977
00:46:37.400 --> 00:46:39.540
He was excited to become Golden Face.
他很高兴能变成黄金脸。

978
00:46:40.400 --> 00:46:44.940
You have no idea how excited John was to film Threat Level Midnight.
你根本不知道约翰拍《午夜威胁》时有多兴奋。

979
00:46:45.000 --> 00:46:46.220
All of it.
全情投入。

980
00:46:46.920 --> 00:46:53.780
Later, we're going to get to that skating scene where he's in that just ridiculous skating outfit with the gold face.
等一会儿，我们要看到那个溜冰的场景了，他穿着那套涂着金脸、简直荒谬绝伦的溜冰服。

981
00:46:54.620 --> 00:46:57.240
He was so on board for all of it.
他对这一切都极其配合。

982
00:46:57.320 --> 00:46:58.900
And you can see it in his performance.
你从他的表演中就能看出来。

983
00:46:59.200 --> 00:47:02.460
It is so incredibly charming and fun.
实在是太有魅力、太有趣了。

984
00:47:02.880 --> 00:47:06.560
John's performance as Golden Face is one of my favorite parts of Threat Level Midnight.
约翰对黄金脸的演绎是我最喜欢《午夜威胁》的片段之一。

985
00:47:06.920 --> 00:47:07.320
Same.
我也是。

986
00:47:07.660 --> 00:47:13.120
John is going to have a talking head where he said, obviously, you know, he didn't love the dialogue of Golden Face.
约翰等会儿会有个访谈镜头，他说很显然，你知道的，他其实不太喜欢黄金脸的台词。

987
00:47:13.120 --> 00:47:18.380
He didn't love saying that he was going to dig up Scarn's wife and hump her real good.
他不喜欢说要挖出斯卡恩的妻子然后狠狠地强暴她之类的话。

988
00:47:18.520 --> 00:47:18.720
Yeah.
对。

989
00:47:18.980 --> 00:47:22.600
But he obviously took the part to impress a receptioniSt.
但他接演这个角色显然是为了给前台留下深刻印象。

990
00:47:23.020 --> 00:47:24.380
This scene was longer.
这个场景原来更长一些。

991
00:47:24.580 --> 00:47:27.360
It's in the extended cut that's on the DVD.
它在 DVD 收录的加长版里。

992
00:47:27.640 --> 00:47:28.500
I remember it.
我还记得。

993
00:47:28.580 --> 00:47:29.180
It's amazing.
太棒了。

994
00:47:29.600 --> 00:47:29.860
Yeah.
是啊。

995
00:47:30.140 --> 00:47:31.200
So Golden Face leaves.
所以黄金脸离开了。

996
00:47:31.320 --> 00:47:35.060
And when he does, the hostages quickly are like, we've got to pick a leader.
而他一走，人质们立马就觉得：我们得选个领头人。

997
00:47:35.320 --> 00:47:38.180
I went to the shooting draft as well because I wanted to read it.
我也查阅了拍摄剧本，因为我想读一读。

998
00:47:38.180 --> 00:47:42.780
Roy says, we need to choose a leader, someone tough enough to take on Golden Face.
罗伊说，我们需要选一个领头人，一个足够强硬能对付黄金脸的人。

999
00:47:43.080 --> 00:47:45.300
And Pam says, I can be the leader.
然后帕姆说，我可以当领头人。

1000
00:47:46.020 --> 00:47:48.140
Kevin's like, you, what makes you so tough?
凯文就说：就你，有什么资格说自己强硬？

1001
00:47:48.280 --> 00:47:54.020
And Pam says, I have experience as a leader, a negotiator, a general, and a cop.
然后帕姆说，我有作为领袖、谈判专家、将军和警察的经验。

1002
00:47:54.160 --> 00:47:56.040
In other words, I'm a mom.
换句话说，我是一名母亲。

1003
00:47:56.160 --> 00:47:57.580
I remember that line.
我记得这句台词。

1004
00:47:58.760 --> 00:48:00.460
Everyone smiles and nods.
每个人都微笑着点头。

1005
00:48:00.620 --> 00:48:05.840
Toby puts his hand on Pam's leg and says, yeah, it'll be Sandra.
托比把手放在帕姆的腿上说，没错，会是桑德拉。

1006
00:48:06.680 --> 00:48:08.420
That was your character's name.
那是你角色的名字。

1007
00:48:09.900 --> 00:48:14.800
So then Golden Face is going to re-enter and Pam goes, gulp.
所以接下来黄金面具要重新登场，帕姆就做出了“咕嘟”吞口水的动作。

