不会吧。

1037
00:49:44.120 --> 00:49:44.500
Yes.
是的。

1038
00:49:44.680 --> 00:49:45.980
But we couldn't get him.
但我们没能请到他。

1039
00:49:46.060 --> 00:49:48.440
He was filming a movie in, like, Hungary or something.
他当时在匈牙利还是什么地方拍电影。

1040
00:49:48.700 --> 00:49:50.160
Did Randy tell you that?
兰迪跟你说的吗？

1041
00:49:50.220 --> 00:49:51.000
I didn't know that.
我不知道这件事。

1042
00:49:51.160 --> 00:49:56.640
Randy said that the logistics of getting Idris on an international flight for one day of
兰迪说要把伊德瑞斯弄上国际航班，来范奈司

1043
00:49:56.640 --> 00:49:59.840
shooting in Van Nuys was, quote, too big a hurdle to overcome.
拍一天的戏，这个后勤难度“实在太难克服了”。

1044
00:50:00.600 --> 00:50:02.220
So, BJ pivoted.
所以，B·J·转换了思路。

1045
00:50:02.400 --> 00:50:05.680
He rewrote the part for Creed, which I love.
他为克里德重写了这个角色，我超爱这个改动。

1046
00:50:06.100 --> 00:50:06.800
Oh, my God.
哦，天哪。

1047
00:50:06.800 --> 00:50:08.360
I loved everything about it.
我喜欢关于它的所有一切。

1048
00:50:08.400 --> 00:50:09.740
I loved his tassel jacket.
我喜欢他的流苏夹克。

1049
00:50:09.760 --> 00:50:11.240
It's very Karate Kid.
非常有《龙威小子》的感觉。

1050
00:50:11.480 --> 00:50:12.880
You got to mop the ice.
你得去擦冰面。

1051
00:50:13.020 --> 00:50:13.600
Mop the ice.
拖冰面。

1052
00:50:13.600 --> 00:50:15.220
Why do I have to mop the ice?
为什么我非得拖冰面？

1053
00:50:15.300 --> 00:50:15.940
You'll see.
你等会儿就知道了。

1054
00:50:16.200 --> 00:50:20.140
We also got a fan question from Angie in Birmingham, Alabama, who said,
我们还收到了来自阿拉巴马州伯明翰的安吉发来的粉丝提问，她问：

1055
00:50:20.300 --> 00:50:23.840
what is the song that is playing while Michael is mopping the ice?
迈克尔在拖冰面时放的那首歌是什么歌？

1056
00:50:24.680 --> 00:50:28.160
Angie, that is the Billy Joel song, Running on Ice.
安吉，那是比利·乔尔的歌《在冰上奔跑》。

1057
00:50:28.660 --> 00:50:35.520
Randy said it cost us $40,000 for that song and that montage of Michael doing his bowflex
兰迪说这首歌花了我们四万美元，还有迈克尔做动感健腹器

1058
00:50:36.060 --> 00:50:37.380
and mopping the ice.
以及拖冰面的蒙太奇。

1059
00:50:37.820 --> 00:50:40.880
Steve doing the bowflexes in the bloopers.
史蒂夫在NG镜头里做动感健腹器。

1060
00:50:41.600 --> 00:50:42.680
There's no music.
根本没有音乐。

1061
00:50:42.880 --> 00:50:44.220
You know, they added the music later.
你知道的，音乐是后来加进去的。

1062
00:50:44.460 --> 00:50:46.920
It looks like they're, like, throwing water on him.
看起来他们好像在往他身上泼水。

1063
00:50:46.980 --> 00:50:47.320
I don't know.
我不知道。

1064
00:50:47.380 --> 00:50:51.820
But he's going, and he just cracks himself up.
但他一直在弄，而且他自己忍不住笑场了。

1065
00:50:52.760 --> 00:50:58.580
I also noticed there are really good, like, figure skaters skating behind Michael as he's
我还注意到，就在迈克尔学滑冰的时候，

1066
00:50:58.580 --> 00:50:59.340
learning to skate.
他身后有非常厉害的花样滑冰运动员在滑冰。

1067
00:50:59.460 --> 00:51:00.440
I saw that as well.
我也看到了。

1068
00:51:00.960 --> 00:51:05.540
Next up, our director, Michael, is going to do that classic thing that happens in movies
接下来，我们的导演迈克尔要上演电影里的那种经典桥段，

1069
00:51:05.540 --> 00:51:08.380
where they show a passage of time with this calendar, right?
就是通过这个日历来表现时间的流逝，对吧？

1070
00:51:08.540 --> 00:51:10.400
The dates are falling on the ground.
日历的日期一张张落到地上。

1071
00:51:10.460 --> 00:51:13.020
It's one of those page-a-day tear-off calendars.
那是那种一天一页的撕历。

1072
00:51:13.020 --> 00:51:19.420
Well, it was a Dave Barry calendar, and BJ told us that Dave Barry was a favorite of his
嗯，那是一本戴夫·巴里的日历，B.J.告诉我们，戴夫·巴里在他

1073
00:51:19.420 --> 00:51:21.940
in his formative years, and he loved his comedy.
成长时期是他最喜欢的作家，他非常喜欢他的喜剧。

1074
00:51:22.200 --> 00:51:27.900
He would read Dave's books out loud at summer camps to make other kids laugh, and so he was
他会在夏令营里大声朗读戴夫的书来逗笑其他孩子，所以他

1075
00:51:27.900 --> 00:51:31.340
really excited to have this calendar be part of Threat Level Midnight.
非常高兴能让这本日历成为《威胁级别：午夜》的一部分。

1076
00:51:31.540 --> 00:51:32.380
I love that.
我太喜欢这个了。

1077
00:51:32.780 --> 00:51:39.680
I love imagining BJ at summer camp reading a Dave Barry book to the other campers.
我脑补B.J.在夏令营里给其他营员读戴夫·巴里的书的画面，

1078
00:51:39.780 --> 00:51:40.520
It's so cute.
太可爱了。

1079
00:51:40.520 --> 00:51:45.660
Randy also shared with us that when they reached out to Dave Barry's legal representation to
兰迪还跟我们分享说，当他们联系戴夫·巴里的法律团队

1080
00:51:45.660 --> 00:51:50.840
see if they could use his calendar, his assistant, Judy Smith, was a huge fan of the show.
看是否能使用他的日历时，他的助理朱迪·史密斯是这部剧的超级粉丝。

1081
00:51:51.000 --> 00:51:52.200
That always helps.
这总是很有帮助。

1082
00:51:52.500 --> 00:51:52.820
Yes.
是的。

1083
00:51:53.260 --> 00:51:57.160
Dave was out of town, but Judy tracked him down, got his permission.
戴夫当时不在城里，但朱迪联系到了他，并获得了他的许可。

1084
00:51:58.000 --> 00:52:02.120
So Randy said a big thank you to Judy Smith for helping us make this happen.
所以兰迪向朱迪·史密斯表达了由衷的感谢，感谢她帮我们促成了此事。

1085
00:52:02.860 --> 00:52:08.720
And on the commentary, Charlie shared that Dave Barry also sent in a letter to the writers
在评论音轨中，查理分享说戴夫·巴里还给编剧们寄了一封信

1086
00:52:08.720 --> 00:52:13.300
