My left boob is kind of falling out of the cup.
我的左胸有点从罩杯里掉出来了。

1102
00:52:46.140 --> 00:52:46.190
Of your bra?
你内衣的？

1103
00:52:46.190 --> 00:52:46.720
Right now?
现在吗？

1104
00:52:46.720 --> 00:52:50.600
It's not completely falling out, but it's more out.
倒不是完全掉出来，但就是露得比较多。

1105
00:52:50.800 --> 00:52:55.660
