No, I've never gotten them properly measured.
不，我从来没有去好好量过尺寸。

1138
00:54:07.300 --> 00:54:07.600
Okay.
好吧。

1139
00:54:07.600 --> 00:54:08.020
Okay.
好吧。

1140
00:54:09.000 --> 00:54:11.000
Here's my other thing that's going through my mind.
我脑子里在想的另一件事是。

1141
00:54:11.120 --> 00:54:13.380
I went to get my mammogram.
我去做了乳腺X光检查。

1142
00:54:13.600 --> 00:54:14.920
You guys, I've been putting it off.
姐妹们，我一直拖着没去。

1143
00:54:15.080 --> 00:54:16.500
Jenna fussed at me hardcore.
珍娜狠狠地唠叨了我一顿。

1144
00:54:16.960 --> 00:54:18.880
